    {
      "name": "table_05.csv",
      "caption": "Table 5: Test perplexity on WikiText-103. We used adaptive inputs similar to DBLP:journals/corr/abs-1809-10853 and show that our method yields better perplexity than dynamic convolutions and comparative performance with self-attention.",
